Once you’ve uploaded your beat on Beat22, you can make changes to **some parts but not everything.**

### **What you *can* edit:**

-   **Metadata** (Beat Title, Genre, Mood, BPM, Tags, etc.)
-   **License settings** (Prices, Terms, License types)

### **What you *can’t* edit:**

-   **Tagged MP3 file**
-   **Untagged WAV file**
-   **WAV + Stems zip file**
-   **Cover Art**

## **Want to change media files?**

If you need to update any of the media files (audio or artwork), you’ll need to:

1.  Delete the current beat
2.  Re-upload it from scratch, filling out all metadata and license info again

#### ***Pro Tip:** Double-check all media before uploading to save time later!*
